{"3955000": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Mars Training Camp", "steam_appid": 3955000, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mars Training Camp is a simulation of building the first human base on Mars. It is based on the actual science, plans and proposed technologies of NASA, SpaceX and international partners for the future Mission to Mars. The player meets their team, explores the Starship and Mars landscape by walking or driving a Cyber truck. Player must find ice for oxygen to breathe and hydrogen for rocket fuel, and must build critical facilities. Player must respond to emergencies of fire, low supply of oxygen, meteors, tornadoes and malfunctioning humanoid robots with bad AI. </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mars Training Camp is a simulation of building the first human base on Mars. It is based on the actual science, plans and proposed technologies of NASA, SpaceX and international partners for the future Mission to Mars. The player meets their team, explores the Starship and Mars landscape by walking or driving a Cyber truck. Player must find ice for oxygen to breathe and hydrogen for rocket fuel, and must build critical facilities. Player must respond to emergencies of fire, low supply of oxygen, meteors, tornadoes and malfunctioning humanoid robots with bad AI. </p>", "short_description": "Mars Training Camp is a simulation to build the human first base on Mars based on NASA and SpaceX science and plans. You must find ice and build critical facilities of green houses, O2 &amp; H gas plant, launch pads and a habitat, and react just in time to emergencies of fire and low oxygen supply.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955000/5811356e6c6e38a3f58d39e6757f720664e49187/header.jpg?t=1758206563", "capsule_image":